(text "+5 V is on a separate STANDARD 16-pin interface, never added to the 10-pin standard.\nJ2 is an OFF-BOARD harness connector, not placed on either PCB. Exact crimp/IDC part and strain relief remain open.\nRED STRIPE / pins 1 and 2 = -12 V. CV (13/14) and GATE (15/16) intentionally NC.\nDo not trust key position alone. Continuity-test each cable; do not parallel this output with another supply." (at 16 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "52dffeaf-5a3f-5dd7-a751-19349bded3dd"))
